<title>USA: Republic Industries sells ADT shrs.</title>
<headline>Republic Industries sells ADT shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said it sold 15 million shares of ADT Ltd for $27.50 per share, or $412.5 million, early Wednesday in five transactions.</p>
<p>The shares represent warrants Republic exercised in March at $20 per share, or $300 million. Republic had received the warrants last year as part of its failed effort to buy ADT.</p>
<p>ADT has struck a merger agreement with Tyco International Ltd, but is still being pursued by hostile bidder Western Resources Inc.</p>
</text>
